e_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Develops smoothness from the quotient of moments before differentiating, then transfers the quantitative spatial-moment inequality through local constant replacements at a fixed interior time. Compact-strip stability is a cited input; positivity is asserted only for 0<t<1, and the argument does not transfer third time derivatives or add formal acceptance."}],"target_ref":"sha256:1197ef489fa4b81b6170cd18c9ad07619ff01cff808caaa8df113602e3158c01/papers/long.json","target_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Derives the smooth-density part through a continuous quotient and simultaneous polynomial-moment bootstrap. Strict positivity is the separate density-positive passage; full support alone does not establish either conclusion."}],"to":"sha256:4c6350e9b4de8b6fa8cb1160f0ada57e4a2b797aebd0c518c88b1ace1b27878b/papers/long.md/sha256:1197ef489fa4b81b6170cd18c9ad07619ff01cff808caaa8df113602e3158c01/papers/long.json/passages/density"},{"annotation_basis":"shared_claim_ids","derived":true,"from":"sha256:2a6b208513ac25e44095e066ddcc0a7e6f4d72408bed9676c6769b64a4f070b6/papers/short.md/sha256:bcc7bf0c188af4803b9e70d98d8da2a26ca32b5828f5cf01605037aa8c5b71f5/papers/short.json/passages/density-consequence","id":"shared-claims:b297d99663bdf5a38265500244473871788ad70424642c3bb25bc562e74b0677","kind":"shared_claim","selection_relation":"outgoing","shared_claim_refs":["sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"],"source_field":"passages.claim_ids","source_ref":"sha256:bcc7bf0c188af4803b9e70d98d8da2a26ca32b5828f5cf01605037aa8c5b71f5/papers/short.json","source_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92